<title>MOROCCO: Morocco buys 40,000T soft wheat at $155-$158/tonne.</title>
<headline>Morocco buys 40,000T soft wheat at $155-$158/tonne.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan private traders purchased 40,000 tonnes of Argentine soft wheat at between $155 and $158 per tonne C&amp;F for December delivery, a member of the Casablanca-based cereal importers committee said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
